WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Magic-state cultivation: a 104-qubit protocol
simulated on JUPITER.

00:02.500 --> 00:07.500
Prepare a magic state in a small color code,
providing a resource for universal quantum computing.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.000
Flag measurements help identify harmful faults
as the encoded state is cultivated.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
Grow from a distance-3 color code
toward a distance-7 hybrid color/surface code.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
Two rounds of checks grow
and protect the encoded state.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
The model includes coherent phase errors
and leakage beyond two levels at selected sites.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
8,192 GPUs distribute 35 trillion complex amplitudes,
with 512 TiB of state-vector memory.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
NVIDIA cuQuantum on JUPITER, with development
and validation supported by NVAQC.
